 avahi-utils,
 eject,
 iproute2,
 lsscsi,
 open-iscsi,
 pkexec,
 polkitd,
 psmisc,
 python3,
 python3-rtslib-fb,
 sg3-utils,
 targetcli-fb,
 udev,
 udisks2
Description: share physical optical drives between ECZOS computers
 Discovers local CD, DVD and Blu-ray drives, publishes explicitly shared drives
 over DNS-SD, exports them through Linux LIO pSCSI and connects remote drives
 through Open-iSCSI as normal local SCSI optical devices.
